  annotation = {中文辅助译名：虚拟现实技术在城市规划中的应用},
  abstract = {As one of the supporting technologies of the digital city,the virtual reality technology shows great significance to the urban planning.Embarking from the concept of virtual reality,the dissertation elaborate three essential features and the technical system constitutions of virtual reality,and it analyzes the key technologies and the superiority of the application of VR technology in the urban planning.Taking the Pearl River new town as the example,it discuss the implementation step of VR technology applied in the urban planning.Finally,it appraises the virtual reality system of Pearl River new town,and proposes several insufficient spots on the application of VR technology in urban planning.},
